1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Every search, video, and website visit can contribute to how digital platforms understand us.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Account data is fragmented, difficult to compare, and difficult to interpret. People need evidence, not assumptions.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Meet SOVRIVA: Your Digital Identity. Your Control.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
SOVRIVA is a local-first privacy intelligence platform for individuals, educators, and researchers.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Users import supported Google or Meta exports, and the analysis stays on their computer.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:59,000
The local engine validates archives, detects duplicates, and preserves the original evidence.

7
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Profile Drift separates new, retained, removed with supporting evidence, and uncertain records.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Cross-platform comparison avoids weak matches, and every finding has a source trail.

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Users can record a privacy action and compare it with a later export. SOVRIVA reports an observed change, no change observed, or not verifiable.

10
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:59,000
The Chrome and Edge extension adds protection using normalized metadata and Manifest V3 rules. Ad blocking and tracker protection remain independent across three modes.

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:20,000
FastAPI, SQLite, and explainable classification make the system local and reproducible. The next step is an optional local model evaluated with precision, recall, and macro-F1.

12
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:31,000
SOVRIVA can support individuals, universities, educators, researchers, and institutions without selling personal data.

13
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Our working prototype helps people understand evidence, compare change, and control what happens next. SOVRIVA. Your Digital Identity. Your Control.
